  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Coal India CIL Management Trainee MT Recruitment 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-11T10:11:37+05:30\">June 11, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">10:11 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.coalindia.in/\">Coal India Limited (CIL)</a></strong>&nbsp;has released <strong>a notification</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Management Trainee MT Posts.</strong> This recruitment is for <strong>660 positions.</strong> <strong>CIL</strong> Application Form has started on <strong>12 May 2026</strong> &amp; the candidates can apply until <strong>21 June 2026 (Extended).</strong> Minimum age is not required &amp; The Maximum Age limit Is <strong>30 Years</strong> as on <strong>30 April 2026.</strong> Candidates must check the complete details for <strong>Coal India CIL Management Trainee MT Recruitment 2026.</strong> which are given below. <strong>(<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt. No. : 03/2026</span>)</strong></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Coal India CIL Management Trainee MT Online Form 2026 – Extended</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Coal India CIL Management Trainee MT Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/coal-india-cil-mt-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>12 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date&nbsp; : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>21 June 2026 (Extended)</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date Pay Exam Fee : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>21 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date<strong> : Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declare Date: <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>CIL</strong><b>&nbsp;</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General, OBC, EWS</strong> : <strong>₹</strong> <b>1180/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> SC, ST, PH</strong> : <strong>₹</strong><b> 00/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Coal India CIL Management Trainee MT Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 30 April 2026</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<b>NA</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<b>30 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>CIL </b>provides age relaxation for the <strong>Management Trainee (MT)&nbsp;</strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">660 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Coal India CIL Management Trainee MT Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Discipline</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Civil</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">178</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cgmc9m\" data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"163\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"161\">Bachelor’s Degree in the relevant branch of Engineering with a minimum of 60% marks</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uc6kff\" data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"220\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"218\">For SC/ST candidates: Minimum 55% marks required</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Electrical</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">221</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cgmc9m\" data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"140\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"138\">Bachelor’s Degree in the relevant branch of Engineering with a minimum of 60% marks</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dui5lc\" data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"193\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"191\">SC/ST candidates: Minimum 55% marks required</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mechanical</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">145</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cgmc9m\" data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"140\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"138\">Bachelor’s Degree in the relevant branch of Engineering with a minimum of 60% marks</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dui5lc\" data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"193\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"191\">SC/ST candidates: Minimum 55% marks required</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">System</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">43</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate must have a <strong data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"96\">recognized First Class degree in B.E./B.Tech./B.Sc. (Engineering)</strong> in <strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"169\">Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or Information Technology</strong>. Alternatively, candidates with <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"291\">any recognized First Class degree along with an MCA (Master of Computer Applications)</strong> are also eligible.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Electronics &amp;</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Communication</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">38</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"135\">B.E./B.Tech./B.Sc. (Engineering) degree in the relevant branch of Engineering with a minimum of 60% marks</strong>. For <strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"185\">SC/ST candidates, a minimum of 55% marks</strong> is required.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Geology</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">15</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have an <strong data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"138\">M.Sc. or M.Tech. in Geology, Applied Geology, Geophysics, or Applied Geophysics with a minimum of 60% marks</strong>. For <strong data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"188\">SC/ST candidates, a minimum of 55% marks</strong> is required.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5271%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Industrial</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Engineering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4668%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">11</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.006%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-